  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Not considering the electronic spin, the degeneracy of the second excited state (n = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>) of H atom is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math>, while the degeneracy of the second excited state of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> is :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Energy order of orbitals of H is decided by only principle quantum number (n) while energy order of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> is decided by <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math> rule:<br />Electronic configuration of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></math> is <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> its energy order is decided by <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></math> rule.<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Its <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> excited state is 2p<br />And degeneracy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
